# CMDEDIT-LBL-08: element add rectangle r1; configure flags persistent; save and reload; element names; element inbox.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/tiny -noprompt
load a
element add rectangle r1 white 0 0 10 10
element configure r1 flags persistent
element names
save a
load b
load a
element names
box -1 -1 11 11
element inbox
